  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: <style=title><size=42>ARGON BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: '<size=22>- During each reel spin, Argon Bonus could be randomly triggered.

      - When triggered, the reel set expands by 4 rows to 8x5 and changes to a 148
      line game.

      - After reel expansion, Argon may use his fire breath to turn random symbols
      Wild.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: '<size=22>- 3 or more Scatters in any position triggers Free Games.

      - During Free Games, reel set expands by 4 rows to 8x5 and changes to a 148
      line game.

      - During Free Games, Argon randomly turns symbols Wild using his fire breath.

      - 3 or more Scatters in any positions awards additional Free Games.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=22>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.'
